{"ticker":"AXON","updated":"2026-10-30T22:35:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Axon Enterprise, Inc.","shortName":"Axon Enterprise, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.axon.com","fullTimeEmployees":5100,"marketCap":34750926848,"trailingPE":177.49791,"forwardPE":40.688114,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":10.795235,"pegRatio":1.58,"targetMeanPrice":680.3684,"targetHighPrice":830.0,"targetLowPrice":440.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.353,"earningsGrowth":-0.182,"grossMargins":0.59525,"operatingMargins":0.0517,"profitMargins":0.06191,"totalRevenue":3219098880,"beta":1.439,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":749.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":339.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Axon Enterprise, Inc. provides public safety technology solutions in the United States and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Software and Services, and Connected Devices. The Software and Services segment develops, manufactures, and sells cloud-based software-as-a-service solutions to capture, store, manage, share, and analyze video and other digital evidence. This segment also offers Axon Evidence, Draft One, Axon Records, Axon Standards, Axon Fusus, Axon Assistant, and others. The Connected Devices segment engages in the development, manufacture, and sale of integrated hardware solutions, such as conducted energy devices under the TASER brand, body cameras, fixed and in-car cameras, drone and counter-drone technologies, accessories, extended warranties, and related hardware products, as well as virtual reality training hardware. The company serves first responders across international, federal, state, and local governments, international governmental entities, commercial enterprises, and consumers through direct sales, distribution partners, and third-party resellers. The company was formerly known as TASER International, Inc. and changed its name to Axon Enterprise, Inc. in April 2017. Axon Enterprise, Inc. was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Scottsdale, Arizona.","summary_zh":"Axon Enterprise, Inc. 在美國和國際上提供公共安全技術解決方案。該公司分為兩個部門：軟體和服務部門以及連接設備部門。軟體和服務部門開發、製造和銷售基於雲端的軟體即服務解決方案，以捕獲、儲存、管理、共享和分析影片和其他數位證據。該部分還提供 Axon Evidence、Draft One、Axon Records、Axon Standards、Axon Fusus、Axon Assistant 等。連接設備部門從事整合硬體解決方案的開發、製造和銷售，例如TASER品牌的傳導能源設備、隨身攝影機、固定和車載攝影機、無人機和反無人機技術、配件、延長保固和相關硬體產品，以及虛擬實境培訓硬體。該公司透過直銷、分銷合作夥伴和第三方經銷商為國際、聯邦、州和地方政府、國際政府實體、商業企業和消費者的急救人員提供服務。該公司前身為 TASER International, Inc.，於 2017 年 4 月更名為 Axon Enterprise, Inc.。 Axon Enterprise, Inc. 成立於 1993 年，總部位於亞利桑那州斯科茨代爾。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":733.81,"h":748.83,"l":726.0,"c":743.59,"v":494300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":737.26,"h":738.0,"l":713.21,"c":725.29,"v":635200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":725.78,"h":731.19,"l":719.0,"c":730.16,"v":383600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":731.0,"h":738.77,"l":708.76,"c":728.41,"v":398100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":736.37,"h":750.0,"l":733.88,"c":740.61,"v":608800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":734.09,"h":740.0,"l":718.0,"c":731.98,"v":311800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":736.66,"h":750.96,"l":734.26,"c":747.55,"v":481300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":751.61,"h":765.01,"l":745.43,"c":751.11,"v":467000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":756.66,"h":765.44,"l":754.46,"c":756.13,"v":303800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":760.0,"h":774.32,"l":756.2,"c":760.79,"v":393400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":760.79,"h":766.63,"l":750.65,"c":750.67,"v":484700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":750.67,"h":762.18,"l":748.3,"c":751.81,"v":504200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":756.35,"h":772.0,"l":753.0,"c":766.47,"v":436600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":771.77,"h":779.09,"l":760.01,"c":774.53,"v":1740500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":766.33,"h":778.94,"l":761.55,"c":775.92,"v":406900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":769.16,"h":792.16,"l":768.22,"c":777.58,"v":449000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":789.29,"h":789.29,"l":697.8,"c":698.02,"v":1192500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":696.97,"h":723.15,"l":694.54,"c":